# Only the docs site deploys. Keep the API service, its fixtures, and every
# secret out of the upload — but curriculum/ and docs/ must stay, because the
# sync script reads them at build time.
#
# Leading slashes matter: a bare "src" would also match website/src.
/src
/scripts
/evals
/data
/storefront
/node_modules
/scratch
.env
.env.local
website/node_modules
website/build
website/.docusaurus
